{"slug":"Gala_Galactic_Cup","title":"Galactic Gala Cup","cats":["OpenFront Masters","Teams"],"headings":[{"id":"Format","text":"Format","level":2},{"id":"Broadcast_Talent","text":"Broadcast Talent","level":3},{"id":"Placements","text":"Placements","level":3},{"id":"Participants","text":"Participants","level":2},{"id":"Results","text":"Results","level":2}],"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"fo-nttax-infobox-container\" data-analytics-infobox-type=\"Tournament\" data-analytics-name=\"Infobox\"><div class=\"fo-nttax-infobox-wrapper infobox-lab\"><div class=\"fo-nttax-infobox\"><div><div class=\"infobox-header wiki-backgroundcolor-light\">Galactic Gala Cup</div></div><div><div class=\"infobox-header wiki-backgroundcolor-light infobox-header-2\">League Information</div></div><div><div class=\"infobox-cell-2 infobox-description\">Series:</div><div style=\"width:50%\">Galactic Gala Series</div></div><div><div class=\"infobox-cell-2 infobox-description\">Organizer:</div><div style=\"width:50%\">Galactic Gala</div></div><div><div class=\"infobox-cell-2 infobox-description\">Type:</div><div style=\"width:50%\">Online</div></div><div><div class=\"infobox-cell-2 infobox-description\">Location:</div><div style=\"width:50%\"><span class=\"flag\"><a href=\"https://liquipedia.net/lab/Category:World\" title=\"World\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"World\" src=\"/images/liquipedia/World_hd.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"36\" height=\"24\"></a></span>&nbsp;World</div></div><div><div class=\"infobox-cell-2 infobox-description\">Date:</div><div style=\"width:50%\">2024-05-30</div></div><div class=\"\"><div class=\"infobox-cell-2 infobox-description\">Liquipedia Tier:</div><div style=\"width:50%\"><span class=\"wiki-deadlink\">D-Tier</span></div></div><div><div class=\"infobox-header wiki-backgroundcolor-light infobox-header-2\">Links</div></div><div><div class=\"infobox-center infobox-icons\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://discord.gg/https://discord.gg/BPzswFbjvE\"><i class=\"lp-icon lp-discord\"></i></a></div></div></div><div class=\"fo-nttax-infobox-adbox\"></div><div></div></div><div class=\"fo-nttax-infobox-topcontent\"></div></div>\n<p>The Galactic Gala is a tournament hosted by Nvr_Kn with help from Barney and CosmicVoidArchon. It utilizes an Ironman-like tournament format which has not yet been used in OpenFront.\n</p>\n\n\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Format\">Format</h2></div>\n<ul><li><b>Playoffs:</b> May 30th, 2026.\n<ul><li>All trios will play an Ironman formatted scoring system in a standard Battle Royale mode.</li>\n<li>Each trio will have 100 points to start with, and lose points based on any placements below first.</li>\n<li>Once a trio loses all 100 points, they will be eliminated.\n<ul><li>If teams are narrowed to a 3v3, the map will default to Australia.</li>\n<li>Maps will be played in this order until a 3v3 is reached or the series concludes: Australia, Europe, New York City, MENA, Black Sea, Manicougan. In case all maps are played and beyond 3 teams still remain, maps will be replayed in an unspecified order.</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Broadcast_Talent\">Broadcast Talent</h3></div>\n<div><div class=\"template-box\" style=\"padding-right:2em;\">\n<ul><li><b>Commentators:</b>\n<ul><li><span class=\"flag\"><a href=\"https://liquipedia.net/lab/Category:Italy\" title=\"Italy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Italy\" src=\"/images/liquipedia/It_hd.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"36\" height=\"24\"></a></span>&nbsp;<span class=\"wiki-deadlink\">Deshack</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"flag\"><a href=\"https://liquipedia.net/lab/Category:United_States\" title=\"United States\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"United States\" src=\"/images/liquipedia/Us_hd.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"36\" height=\"24\"></a></span>&nbsp;<span class=\"wiki-deadlink\">EagleEye</span></li></ul></li></ul>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Placements\">Placements</h3></div>\n<div class=\"prizepool-section-wrapper\"><span>$<abbr title=\"To Be Announced\">TBA</abbr>&nbsp;<abbr title=\"United States Dollar\">USD</abbr> are spread among the participants as seen below:<br></span><div class=\"prizepool-section-tables\"><div style=\"overflow-x:auto\"><details class=\"liq-collapse\"><summary>Prize pool</summary><div class=\"csstable-widget collapsed general-collapsible prizepooltable prizepooltable-placement\" style=\"grid-template-columns:repeat(2, auto);width:max-content\"><div class=\"csstable-widget-row prizepooltable-header\" style=\"font-weight:bold\"><div class=\"csstable-widget-cell\" style=\"min-width:80px\">Place</div><div class=\"csstable-widget-cell prizepooltable-col-team\">Participant</div></div><div class=\"csstable-widget-row background-color-first-place\"><div class=\"csstable-widget-cell prizepooltable-place\" style=\"font-weight:bolder;grid-row:span 1\"><span title=\"First Place\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/images/liquipedia/Gold.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></span>&nbsp;1st</div><div class=\"csstable-widget-cell\" style=\"justify-content:start\"><div class=\"block-team\"><span class=\"team-template-image-icon team-template-lightmode\"><a href=\"https://liquipedia.net/lab/Antares\" title=\"Antares\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/images/liquipedia/Halved_Shield_default_lightmode.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"47\" height=\"50\"></a></span><span class=\"team-template-image-icon team-template-darkmode\"><a href=\"https://liquipedia.net/lab/Antares\" title=\"Antares\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/images/liquipedia/Halved_Shield_default_darkmode.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"47\" height=\"50\"></a></span><span class=\"name\" style